{
  "case_id": "LOCK-OFFLINE-1.20.1",
  "title": "立牌主动「锁定态离线时钟漂移」修复的游戏内取证：**L1–L7**（parunan 的 15 分钟档 + jasmine 短时档 + 忍者宽限）。根因：锁定硬上界 `sign_active_lock_end` 与忍者宽限 `sign_active_lock_grace_end` 是**绝对 gameTime**（服务器在跑就照常推进），   而门控效果的剩余时长只在 `LivingEntity#tickEffects` 里递减（**离线冻结**）⇒ 多人服务器上「离线时长 > 上界剩余」后重登，   上界已过、效果仍在 ⇒ `isSignActiveLocked` 判未锁定 ⇒ 锁定被墙钟单方面提前结束、主动技能提前可用（parunan 15 分钟村庄英雄最严重）。修法（产品侧已落地，本用例按该实现取证）：新增**服务端专用、不同步**的玩家附件 `sign_active_lock_last_seen`；`tickSignActiveLock` **最前面**（早于锁定判定与任何早退）做补偿：`gap = now − last_seen`，**仅当 `gap > 1`** 时把 `lock_end` 与 `grace_end`（**各自 >0 时**）都 `+= gap`；随后把基准刷新为 `now`（两个截止刻都不在时置 0）。`beginActiveLock` 必写 `last_seen = now`、`endLockAndStartCooldown` 必清 0（这两处是「不得凭空补偿」的前提）。**不读任何效果实例**、**不碰 `sign_active_cooldown_end`**、**无 per-sign 代码**。判据 = 探针只读读数 `AP_<tag>_*` 的子串断言（数值相等类一律用探针算出的 0/1 标志）：L1  补偿生效：`signlag <tag> 6000` ⇒ `gap=6000`、`lock_end_delta=6000`、`delta_eq_gap=1`、仍锁定、**冷却不变**；L1b 阈值边界：`gap=1` ⇒ **不补**（`lock_end_delta=0`）；`gap=2` ⇒ 补 2（`>1` 而非 `>=1` 的判据）；L2  正常 tick 不得移动（主判据）：`signlag <tag> 0 triple` ⇒ 连续三拍 `triple_stable=1` 且 `lock_end_delta=0`；    并以 `signstate … mark` → **等 1.2s 真实 tick** → `signstate` 复核 `lock_end_vs_mark=0`（生产路径，非手驱动）；L3  同 tick 幂等：`signlag <tag> 6000 double` ⇒ 第二拍不再补偿（`idem=1`）且总位移仍为 6000；L4  不碰冷却：上述各拍 `cd_unchanged=1`；**锁定期间 `cd_end` 恒为 0**；解锁后（`signend`，cd 已起算）再推 `gap` 仍 `cd_unchanged=1`；L5  锁定仍会正常结束：`signend` 走**内部通道**移除门控效果 ⇒ 锁定清空、`cd_end = now + max_cd − pool`（不得永久锁死）；L6  忍者宽限同被补偿：`lock_end=0` ⇒ 上界**不动**、`grace_end_delta=6000`（`各自 >0 才加` 的逐字段判据）；    三条既有出口行为不变：① 宽限到期 + 未出过效果牌 ⇒ 强重置并起冷却；② 宽限到期 + 已出过效果牌 ⇒ 只清宽限、保持锁定；    ③ 出牌周期**完全重置**（`EffectCardPeriod#onRoundFullyReset`）⇒ 结束锁定起冷却；L7  两线一致：同一用例在两线各跑一次，读数逐条比对（见报告；本用例断言本身两线同构）。回归：nardis **不进入锁定** ⇒ 释放后 `lock=0:lock_end=0:lock_sign=[]` 仍成立（M 组断言的同一口径，重跑一遍）。⚠️ 相位预算（为什么等待都压得很短）：parunan 的三选一效果为**随机**（饱和 30s / 幸运 5:00 / 村庄英雄 15:00），   最短分支 600 tick = **30 秒**；本用例的 parunan 锁定相位总等待 ≈ 10 秒 + 注入开销 ≈ 3 秒，留有 ~2× 余量。   若某条 L 读数出现 `lock_before=0`，先按此排查是否抽到 30 秒分支后相位跑超（**测试相位问题，不是产品缺陷**）。",
  "version": "1.20.1",
  "target": {
    "type": "feature",
    "ref": "sign-active-lock-offline-clock-drift"
  },
  "on_fail": "keep_game_running",
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "目的：以**只读读数**取证 L1–L7（离线时钟漂移补偿）。前置：生存模式 + 清背包；每个立牌组都以 `signreset` 起手。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamemode survival",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 600
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/clear @s",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "① 基线：`signreset L0` = stand 槽清空 + 出牌周期/主动冷却/全部锁定键归零 + `last_seen` 置 0 + 清全部已登记门控效果。   读数为零断言:`ls_wrote=0:ls_after=0`(基线口径与产品「无锁定时置 0」一致) + `sign=[]:lock=0:lock_end=0:grace_end=0:cd_end=0`。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe signreset L0",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe signstate L0S",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "② parunan（15 分钟档，影响最大）：`signprep L1P \"astral_dice:parunan_sign\" 10` 装立牌并给星光（主动要求星光 > 0），   再 `signcast L1C` 走**真实主动** `BaseSignItem#performSkillForCurio` ⇒ 应进入锁定态：`lock=1`、`lock_end>0`、`grace_end=0`、   门控效果在（`gate_on=1`）、基准已被 `beginActiveLock` 落笔（`last_seen_before=0 → last_seen>0`）。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe signprep L1P \"astral_dice:parunan_sign\" 10",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 900
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe signcast L1C",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "②b **首拍不得凭空补偿**（这是我加的边界，不在 L1–L7 编号内，但它是本修复最危险的失败模式）：   `signstate L1M mark` 记下基线 → **等 1.2 秒真实玩家 tick**（生产路径 `PlayerTickEvents` 跑 ~24 拍）→ `signstate L1N` 复核。   若 `beginActiveLock` 没有落笔基准（或产品把 `last_seen=0` 直接当 gap），第一拍就会把上界后移 ≈ 当前 gameTime（数万 tick）   ⇒ `lock_end_vs_mark` 会是巨大的正数。这里要求**恰好为 0**（`grace_end_vs_mark=0`、`cd_vs_mark=0`、`lock_sign_same=1`）。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe signstate L1M mark",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1200
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe signstate L1N",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "②c **L1 补偿生效**：`signlag L1G 6000` = 把 `last_seen` 写到 `now − 6000` → **同一次执行内**驱动 `tickSignActiveLock` → 读回。   （写与驱动必须在同一次命令执行内：拆成两条命令时，中间的真实 tick 会先把补偿吃干并刷新基准。）   期望：`gap=6000`、`lock_end_delta=6000`（`delta_eq_gap=1`）、`grace_end_delta=0`（parunan 的宽限为 0 ⇒ 逐字段守卫跳过）、   `lock_before=1:lock_after=1`（**未迁移到冷却**）、`cd_before=0:cd_after=0:cd_unchanged=1`、锁定标记不变。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe signlag L1G 6000",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 700
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "②d **L1b 阈值边界**（产品的判据是 `gap > 1`，不是 `>= 1`）：`signlag L1H 1` ⇒ `gap=1` **不补偿**；   `signlag L1I 2` ⇒ `gap=2` **补偿 2**。两条合起来把「正常在线相邻两拍(gap=1)绝不动上界」这一防自我延长的关键钉死。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe signlag L1H 1",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 700
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe signlag L1I 2",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 700
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "②e **L2 正常 tick 不得移动（主判据）**：`signlag L2A 0 triple` = 把基准刷成 `now`（等价于「刚见过」）后**连续驱动三拍**，   要求 `triple_stable=1`（三拍的上界逐拍相同）且 `lock_end_delta=0`、`grace_end_delta=0`。   若产品写成 `gap >= 1` 或忘了刷新基准，这里会每拍 +1 ⇒ 上界被无限拉长（锁定永不解）。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe signlag L2A 0 triple",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 700
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "②f **L3 同 tick 幂等**（forge 线 `PlayerTickEvent` 每 tick 触发两次 = START/END）：   `signlag L3A 6000 double` = 写一次基准 → 驱动**两拍**。要求 `idem=1`（第二拍不再补偿）且总位移仍恰为 6000；   `seen_refreshed=1`（补偿那一拍已把基准刷新成 now ⇒ 第二拍 gap=0）。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe signlag L3A 6000 double",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 700
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "②g 负控：非忍者立牌的**出牌周期完全重置**回调不得动它的锁定（`onEffectCardRoundReset` 首行只认忍者）。   `signroundreset L4R` ⇒ `sign_unchanged=1`、`ended=0`、`cd_started=0`（证明无 per-sign 泄漏）。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe signroundreset L4R",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 700
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "②h **L5 锁定仍会正常结束**（不得永久锁死）：`signend L5E` 走**内部通道** `ModEffectRemoval` 移除 parunan 的三个门控效果   （`/effect clear` 对外部无效，已实测）→ 驱动 tick ⇒ `isSignActiveLocked` 转 false ⇒ `endLockAndStartCooldown`：   锁定标记清空、`lock_end=0`、`grace_end=0`、`cd_end = now + max(max_cd − pool, 0) > 0`。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe signend L5E",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "②i **L4 解锁后仍不碰冷却**：此刻冷却已起算且**基准已被 `endLockAndStartCooldown` 清 0** ⇒ 再推 `gap=6000` 必须什么都不动：   `lock_end_delta=0`、`grace_end_delta=0`、`cd_unchanged=1`、`lock_after=0`，并且基准自愈为 0（`last_seen_after=0`）。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe signlag L4N 6000",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 700
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "③ jasmine（短时长档：「清扫」2400 tick = 2:00，门控效果 = `astral_dice:jasmine_sweep`）：同套判据再跑一遍，   证明机制与时长档位无关（`signcast` ⇒ `lock_end>0`；`signlag 6000` ⇒ `+6000`；`signend` ⇒ 正常结束并起冷却）。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe signprep J0 \"astral_dice:jasmine_sign\"",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 900
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe signcast J1",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe signlag J2 6000",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 700
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe signend J3",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "④ 忍者（`komachi_sign`）：锁定**无自身计时器**（`lock_end = 0`），只有宽限 `sign_active_lock_grace_end = now + 1:00`。   这一步是「`各自 >0 时才加`」这条逐字段守卫的**唯一**直接判据：`signlag K1A 6000` 必须**只动宽限**   （`lock_end_delta=0` 且 `grace_end_delta=6000`）。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe signprep K0 \"astral_dice:komachi_sign\"",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 900
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe signcast K1",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe signlag K1A 6000",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 700
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "④b 忍者出口①（宽限到期 + **未出过**任何效果牌）⇒ 强制重置出牌状态并起冷却（锁定结束）：   `signplayed K2P 0` → `signexpiregrace K2A`（把宽限推到 `now − 1` 再驱动 tick）。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe signplayed K2P 0",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 600
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe signexpiregrace K2A",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 900
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "④c 忍者出口③（出牌周期**完全重置**，走产品真实回调 `EffectCardPeriod#onRoundFullyReset`）⇒ 同样结束锁定并起冷却。   先重新构造忍者锁定态，再 `signroundreset K3R`。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe signprep K3 \"astral_dice:komachi_sign\"",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 900
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe signcast K4",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe signroundreset K3R",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 900
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "④d 忍者出口②（宽限到期 + **已出过**效果牌）⇒ 只把宽限刻清 0、**保持锁定**（等出牌周期完全重置）。   先重新构造忍者锁定态 + `signplayed K6P 1`，再 `signexpiregrace K6A`。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe signprep K5 \"astral_dice:komachi_sign\"",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 900
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe signcast K6",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe signplayed K6P 1",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 600
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe signexpiregrace K6A",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 900
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "⑤ 回归：nardis 不覆写锁定入口 ⇒ 释放后必须仍为 `lock=0:lock_end=0:lock_sign=[]`（与 NARDIS-SIGN-* 的 M 组同口径）。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe nardiprep N0 clear",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe nardicast N1",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe nardiread N2 REG",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 700
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "⑥ 收尾：`signreset Z0` 归零锁定态（含基准）→ `nardinuclear Z1` 清临时牌/效果/立牌。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe signreset Z0",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe nardinuclear Z1",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1200
    }
  ],
  "asserts": [
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_L0_SIGNRESET:gate_cleared=[0-9]+:ls_wrote=0:ls_after=0:ls_api=accessor:getSignActiveLockLastSeen:.*:sign=\\[\\]:lock=0:lock_end=0:grace_end=0:cd_end=0:"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
